      ],
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "blockquote",
          "content": {
            "text": "And God said, “Let there be light,” and there was light."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": {
            "text": "The first words God speaks in Scripture call for light, and they come before there is any sun to give it. Genesis 1:3 makes light depend on the word of God, not on the lamps that will later carry it.",
            "annotations": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "start": 106,
                "end": 117,
                "text": "Genesis 1:3",
                "data": {
                  "sv": 1001003
                }
              }
            ],
            "footnote_refs": [
              {
